===Etymology 1===
{{wikidata lexeme|L4497}}
{{etymon|en|id=noun|:inh|enm:animal<id:noun>|tree=1}}
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₂enh₁-}}

{{picdic|image=Lightmatter chimp.jpg
