==English==
{{wp}}
[[Image:Sylvilagus floridanus 14136.JPG|thumb|A rabbit (eastern cottontail, {{taxlink|Sylvilagus floridanus|species}}) (sense 1).]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈɹæbɪt/|a=RP}}, {{enPR|răb'it}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈɹabɪt/|a=SSB}}
** {{audio|en|en-uk-a rabbit.ogg|text=a rabbit|a=SSB}}
* {{a|en|GA}}
** {{IPA|en|/ˈɹæbət/|a=weak vowel}}
** {{IPA|en|/ˈɹæbɪt/|a=non-weak vowel}}
