|passage=And Jerry was cute, you know, I liked him, but Frank was a total '''fox'''. And he was rougher than Jerry, you know, not so cultured.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2012|author=Adele Parks|title=Still Thinking of You|passage=It wasn't just that Jayne was a '''fox''' – although, fuck, was she ever a fox. That arse, those tits, those lips. They could have a really good time together.}}
