{{en-adj|er}}

# Possessing physical features, [[behavior]]s, personality traits or other properties that are mainly attributed to [[infant]]s and small or [[cuddly]] animals; [[e.g.]] fair, dainty, round, and soft physical features, disproportionately large eyes and head, playfulness, fragility, helplessness, curiosity or shyness, innocence, affectionate behavior.
