# {{cap|beneath}}; [[below]]; at or to the [[bottom]] of, or the area [[cover]]ed or [[surmount]]ed by.
#: {{ux|en|We found some shade '''under''' a tree.}}
#: {{ux|en|Quick, stuff the cash '''under''' the mattress!}}
#: {{ux|en|There is nothing new '''under''' the sun.}}
