# {{senseid|en|tabulate}} To [[tabulate]]; to put into a table or grid. {{defdate|from 15th c.}}
#: {{ux|en|to '''table''' fines}}
# {{senseid|en|give food to}} {{lb|en|now|rare}} To supply (a guest, client etc.) with [[food]] at a table; to [[feed]]. {{defdate|from 15th c.}}
