#: {{ux|en|As I was driving along, a dog ran out '''in front of''' me.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1872|author=Charles Hardwick|title=Traditions, Superstitions, and Folklore|url=http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=qFsKAAAAIAAJ&q=%22in+front+of+the+castle%22&dq=%22in+front+of+the+castle%22&pgis=1
|passage=Both parties met '''in front of''' the Castle, the torch-bearers numbering nearly one hundred.}}
# [[in the presence of|In the presence of]], [[in view of]] (someone).
#: {{uxi|en|Don't fight '''in front of''' the children!}}
#* {{quote-av
|en
|url=https://ia800705.us.archive.org/33/items/Penn_Radio_archive/The.Penn.Jillette.Radio.Show.2006.05.09.mp3
|time=11:30
|quotee=Sareen
|date=May 09, 2006
|title=w:Penn Radio
|author=w:Penn Jillette; w:Michael Goudeau
|text=What happened to me was, right '''in front of''' my eyes- I was there with my brother- and right '''in front of''' my eyes, they, a team of monkeys came by to this poor guy that sells fruit for a living- and, I don't know, probably that was all his kids were gonna eat from the, you know, the money he had to make, you know, sell the fruit. But all of the sudden just a bunch of monkeys came by robbed the whole thing he had. It was like thirty of them, just robbed him blind the poor guy. He was chasing them all over. He would chase one and they would jump off and then come back and it was like the funniest thing I've ever seen.}}
# Located [[before]], [[ahead of]], [[previous]] to (someone or something).
#: {{uxi|en|I'll take the one '''in front of''' the black one.}}
#: {{uxi|en|Write ‘Professor’ '''in front of''' her name.}}
#* {{ante|2002}}, “Mandi”, quoted in Nicholas E. Brink, ''Grendel and His Mother: Healing the Traumas of Childhood Through Dreams, Imagery, and Hypnosis'', Baywood Publishing Company, Inc. (2002), {{ISBN|9780895032621}}, [http://books.google.com/books?id=wNh_EKKLU5sC&pg=PA1&dq=%22in+front+of%22 page 1]:
#*: Several people are '''in front of''' me in line. The woman next '''in front of''' me is older, probably in her fifties.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2024|author=NTSB| title=Intersection Crash Between Passenger Car and Combination Vehicle, Tishomingo, Oklahoma, March 22, 2022
   | passage= We determined that the car driver’s transportation of multiple teen passengers, limited driving experience, and likely impairment from effects of cannabis at the time of the crash adversely affected her judgment of the danger of entering the intersection '''in front of''' the approaching combination vehicle.}}

