# Underlying, being the reason for or explanation of.
#: {{ux|en|What is '''behind''' this unexpected decision?}}
# In [[support]] of.
#: {{ux|en|The republicans are fully '''behind''' their candidate.}}
# {{lb|en|sometimes regarded as|_|non-standard|US|informal}} [[following|Following]], subsequent to; [[as a result of|as a result]] or [[consequence]] of; [[because of]].
