|OCLC=1540699
|page=101
|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/journeyofsimonmc0000albe/page/101/
|text=There was a girl in the mattress factory with me during the war, girl about thirty. A big one, kind of a fat face, big '''behind''' to her, big titties, kind of a girl should be human and soft with a man.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2010|author=w:Mary Roach|chapter=One Furry Step for Mankind: The Strange Careers of Ham and Enos|title=[[w:Packing for Mars|Packing for Mars: The Curious Science of Life in the Void]]|publisher=w:W. W. Norton & Company|page=158|isbn=978-0-393-06847-4|text="So the catheter didn't have anything to do with keeping him from touching himself?"  I don't usually go in for euphemisms, but Fineg is a man who says "'''behind'''", as in "I have a picture where he bit me in the '''behind'''."  The catheter, it turns out, was in the chimp's femoral artery (to monitor blood pressure), not his urethra.}}
#* {{quote-web|en|date=12 December 2011|author=Alyssa Newcomb|title=Sit, Stay, Aim, Fire. Dog Shoots Another Hunter|url=https://abcnews.go.com/blogs/headlines/2011/12/sit-stay-aim-fire-dog-shoots-another-hunter/|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20211025015311/https://abcnews.go.com/blogs/headlines/2011/12/sit-stay-aim-fire-dog-shoots-another-hunter/|archivedate=25 October 2021|accessdate=24 October 2021|work=ABC News|text="The dog got excited, was jumping around inside the boat and then it jumped on the gun. It went off, shooting the [decoy setter] in the buttocks," Box Elder County Sheriff's Chief Deputy Kevin Potter told the Salt Lake Tribune.  Twenty-seven rounds of birdshot were removed from the man's '''behind''' after the accident.}}
